WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.220
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Summarise a Long Text.

2
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.076
Make a long text short in seconds. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:14.142
Step one. Copy the text you want to summarise.

4
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:20.194
Step two. Type summarise this in three bullet points, then paste your text.

5
00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:26.871
Step three. Read the summary. Check it against the original. Does it keep the main ideas?

6
00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:36.636
Step four. Adjust it. For example, make it one sentence, or write it for a child. Always check important facts.

7
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:42.067
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:45.551
Summarise a news article in 3 bullet points.

9
00:00:45.851 --> 00:00:47.874
Ask for a one-sentence version.

10
00:00:48.174 --> 00:00:50.417
Check that the main ideas are correct.

11
00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.730
Well done!

